This repository contains material from the OpenQASM project
(https://github.com/openqasm/openqasm), copyright the OpenQASM
contributors and licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0:

- compile/src/stdgates.inc: the OpenQASM 3 standard gate library, shipped
  in the oqi-compile crate.
- lexer.g4 and parser.g4: the reference ANTLR grammar.
- docs/*.rst: the OpenQASM 3 language specification.
- fixtures/qasm/*.qasm: example programs, some of them adapted.

The grammar, the specification and the examples are used for development and
testing and are not part of any published crate.
